<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About | Explore Essence</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <style>
        .about-page {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .about-page h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .gold-divider {
            width: 80px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #D4AF37;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }
        .about-tagline {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: #AAAAAA;
            margin: 10px 0 30px;
        }
        .about-content {
            text-align: left;
            background: #1A1A1A;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #2D2D2D;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .about-content p {
            color: #CCCCCC;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .about-values {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .value-card {
            background: #1A1A1A;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #2D2D2D;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .value-card:hover {
            border-color: #D4AF37;
        }
        .value-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .value-card h4 {
            color: #D4AF37;
        }
        .value-card p {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('../partials/header', { user: locals.user }) %>
    
    <main>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="about-page">
                <h1>✨ About <span class="gold">Explore Essence</span></h1>
                <div class="gold-divider"></div>
                
                <p class="about-tagline">Premium curated goods for the discerning soul.</p>
                
                <div class="about-content">
                    <p>At <strong>Explore Essence</strong>, we believe that everyday objects should tell a story. We carefully curate products that blend timeless design with modern craftsmanship.</p>
                    
                    <p>Each item in our collection is chosen for its quality, character, and the joy it brings to daily life. From our signature golden mugs to our minimalist pour-over drippers, every product is selected with intention.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="about-values">
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">🌍</div>
                        <h4>Global Curated</h4>
                        <p>Sourced from artisans worldwide</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">✨</div>
                        <h4>Quality First</h4>
                        <p>Every item meets our high standards</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
                        <h4>Fair Trade</h4>
                        <p>Supporting ethical production</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/footer', { user: locals.user }) %>
</body>
</html>